@startuml 03d-fields
' 图 03D：@cantilune/observability 字段设计 — 沿用 core 类型 · EventSpine 中轴 · 四 Delta 索引。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title 图 03D · @cantilune/observability 字段设计（沿用 core 类型版）
caption <color:#6E6963>纪律：obs 不新造实体/边类型；Delta/View 继承或组合 @cantilune/core 已有字段 + EventTag 索引。案例 story T0→delegate。</color>

top to bottom direction

package "只读定锚 · ReadDiscipline" #F7F3EC {
  class ReadDiscipline {
    purpose: rule
    .. 四角度描绘 core 协调世界；观察 runtime commit 轨迹 ..
    never_write: rule
    .. 无 put/append/observe 写路径 ..
    core_type_reuse: rule
    .. 公共字段须为 core 类型或 AtEvent&lt;coreType&gt;；禁止平行 Node/Edge/Token ..
    snapshot_authoritative: rule
    .. 实体终态以 ObservationWorld.snapshot 为准；Delta 只记本步 diff ..
    spine_first: rule
    .. 四 View 由 EventSpine fold；lens 读 change + snapshot ..
    four_views_same_event_tag: rule
    .. RFC-0002：同 eventTag 跨读角 join ..
  }
}

package "沿用 · @cantilune/core 实体（01D · 不重定义）" #E5EDE5 {
  class CollaborationSnapshot {
    +participants: Map<ActorId, Participant>
    +artifacts: Map<ArtifactId, WorkArtifact>
    +links: Map<LinkId, CollaborationLink>
    +sessions: Map<SessionId, CommunicationSession>
    +capabilities: Map<CapabilityId, ScopedCapability>
  }
  class Participant
  class WorkArtifact
  class CollaborationLink {
    +linkId / +kind / +from / +to
    .. depends_on · waits_for · nested_in · parallel_with ..
  }
  class ScopedCapability {
    +capabilityId / +holder: ActorId / +scope
  }
  class CommunicationSession {
    +sessionId / +controller: ActorId / +participants
  }
  class CoordinationChange {
    +changeId / +operationTypeId / +matchBindings
    +beforeRef / +afterRef / +createdSessionRefs
  }
  class DerivedDiagnosticView {
    +kind: serial | parallel | nest | box
    .. core/structure/derive · 结构读角复用 ..
  }
}

package "S0 · ObservationWorld · world/" #DDE8F0 {
  class ObservationWorld {
    +snapshotRef: SnapshotRef
    .. snap-S2 ..
    +snapshot: CollaborationSnapshot
    .. 实体权威来源；四读角 join 用 core 品牌 ID ..
    +validatedHistory: RunHistory
    .. [Obs#001, chg-001, chg-002] ..
    +changeIndex: Map<ChangeId, CoordinationChange>
    +sinceRef: SnapshotRef
    .. snap-S0 ..
  }
}

package "S0 · EventSpine · spine/" #DDE8F0 {
  class EventTag {
    +changeId: ChangeId
    +epochId: EpochId
    +operationTypeId: OperationTypeId
    +recordedAt: Timestamp
    .. 跨读角唯一 join；不替代 changeId ..
  }
  class SourceEvent {
    +eventTag: EventTag
    +change: CoordinationChange
    .. 组合 core Change；不重复 matchBindings/createdSessionRefs ..
  }
  class EventSpine {
    +events: SourceEvent[]
    .. 严格同 ChangeLog 序 ..
  }
  class "AtEvent<T>\n读角索引包装" as AtEvent #FFFDFC {
    +eventTag: EventTag
    +value: T
    .. T 须为 core 类型；例 AtEvent&lt;CollaborationLink&gt; ..
  }
}

package "O2 · ProjectionSlice + 四 Delta（core 字段 diff）" #EDE8F0 {
  class ProjectionSlice {
    +eventTag: EventTag
    +dependency: DependencyDelta
    +resource: ResourceDelta
    +communication: CommunicationDelta
    +structure: StructureDelta
  }
  class DependencyDelta {
    +eventTag: EventTag
    +addedLinks: CollaborationLink[]
    .. waits_for reviewer-r→coder-c ..
    +removedLinkIds: LinkId[]
    .. 删边只记 ID；增边带完整 core Link ..
  }
  class ResourceDelta {
    +eventTag: EventTag
    +updatedCapabilities: ScopedCapability[]
    .. delegate 后 write-lock-w.holder=coder-c ..
    .. 本步 after 态切片；终态回 snapshot.capabilities ..
  }
  class CommunicationDelta {
    +eventTag: EventTag
    +openedSessions: CommunicationSession[]
    .. session-s · controller=coder-c ..
    +closedSessionIds: SessionId[]
  }
  class StructureDelta {
    +eventTag: EventTag
    +step: DerivedDiagnosticView
    .. chg-001→box(task-T) · chg-002→nest(session-s) ..
    +structuralLinks: CollaborationLink[]
    .. nested_in · parallel_with；仍用 core Link ..
  }
}

package "O3 · 四角度 View（core 终态 + byEvent 索引）" #EDE8F0 {
  class DependencyView {
    用户视图：FourViewBundle.dependency
    +links: CollaborationLink[]
    .. 终态；filter depends_on|waits_for|delegates_to ..
    +byEvent: Map<EventTag, DependencyDelta>
  }
  class ResourceView {
    用户视图：FourViewBundle.resource
    +capabilities: ScopedCapability[]
    .. 终态；同 snapshot.capabilities 值 ..
    +byEvent: Map<EventTag, ResourceDelta>
  }
  class CommunicationView {
    用户视图：FourViewBundle.communication
    +sessions: CommunicationSession[]
    .. 终态；同 snapshot.sessions ..
    +byEvent: Map<EventTag, CommunicationDelta>
  }
  class StructureView {
    用户视图：FourViewBundle.structure
    +composition: DerivedDiagnosticView
    .. fold StructureDelta.step 为 serial 树 ..
    +structuralLinks: CollaborationLink[]
    .. filter nested_in|parallel_with ..
    +byEvent: Map<EventTag, StructureDelta>
  }
}

package "O4 · FourViewBundle · index/" #E5ECEE {
  class FourViewBundle {
    +spine: EventSpine
    +dependency / +resource / +communication / +structure
    +diagnostic: DiagnosticSummary
    .. 可选；deriveSnapshotStats + Structure 压缩 ..
  }
  class DiagnosticSummary {
    +stats: ReturnType<deriveSnapshotStats>
    .. core deriveSnapshotStatsWithHistory ..
    +compositionHint: DerivedDiagnosticView
    .. 可选；同 StructureView.composition ..
  }
}

package "横切 · CrossViewInvariants" #F0EDE8 {
  class CrossViewInvariants {
    E1_event_coverage: 每 eventTag 四 Delta 至少一处非空
    E2_session_bijection: comm Delta.openedSessions ↔ change.createdSessionRefs
    E3_capability_matches_snapshot: resource View.capabilities = snapshot.capabilities
    E4_link_matches_snapshot: dependency View.links ⊆ snapshot.links（同 linkId 同字段）
    E5_structure_reuses_derive: StructureDelta.step 与 core deriveDiagnosticSummary 逐步一致
    E6_no_parallel_entity_types: bundle 内无 obs 专属 Node/Edge/Token 类型名
    E7_no_scheduling_fields: bundle 无 footprint 字段
  }
}

ReadDiscipline --> ObservationWorld
CollaborationSnapshot <-- ObservationWorld
SourceEvent *-- EventTag
SourceEvent --> CoordinationChange : 组合
EventSpine *-- SourceEvent
AtEvent ..> EventTag
EventSpine --> ProjectionSlice
ProjectionSlice --> DependencyDelta
ProjectionSlice --> ResourceDelta
ProjectionSlice --> CommunicationDelta
ProjectionSlice --> StructureDelta
DependencyDelta --> CollaborationLink
ResourceDelta --> ScopedCapability
CommunicationDelta --> CommunicationSession
StructureDelta --> DerivedDiagnosticView
StructureDelta --> CollaborationLink
FourViewBundle --> DependencyView
FourViewBundle --> ResourceView
FourViewBundle --> CommunicationView
FourViewBundle --> StructureView
DependencyView --> CollaborationLink
ResourceView --> ScopedCapability
CommunicationView --> CommunicationSession
StructureView --> DerivedDiagnosticView
CrossViewInvariants --> FourViewBundle

note bottom of DependencyView
  <b>继承纪律</b>
  同一 linkId 在 dependency/structure 读角
  必须是同一条 CollaborationLink
  Petri/DAG/π/Mor 仅为 RFC 读角标签，非 TS 平行类型
end note

